        ["devtools", "Browser Developer Tools", "Use the inspector, console, network panel, and device emulation to understand page behavior.", "Reproduce a visible issue and trace it to the responsible element, style, or request.", "Find and fix a broken image, a CSS rule conflict, and a failed network request.", [["Chrome DevTools Documentation", "https://developer.chrome.com/docs/devtools/", "documentation"]]]
